  <h2>Published T5 engine figures</h2>
  <p>US-market 2021 S60 T5 specifications are commonly listed at 250 hp at 5,500 rpm and 258 lb-ft at 1,500 rpm. These are model-level figures, not a substitute for the vehicle's build record.</p>

  <h2>AWD configuration</h2>
  <p>The vehicle is confirmed as AWD. The exact transmission code, rear drive unit/angle gear identification, and production-specific component details still need VIN-specific verification. AWD badging alone is not enough to select drivetrain fluids or replacement parts.</p>

  <h2>Remaining build details to verify</h2>
