    <li>Transmission identification and calibration.</li>
    <li>Factory wheel size, tire specification, and spare-tire equipment.</li>
    <li>Installed packages and individual option codes.</li>
    <li>Factory paint code associated with Denim Blue.</li>
    <li>Brake package and rotor dimensions.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Use VIN-specific Volvo build information and the labels on the vehicle before ordering parts or applying service specifications. Keep the full VIN private and out of this public website.</p>

